sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Utilisateur
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant API as API Laravel
  participant DB as Base
  U->>FE: Rédige publication
  FE->>API: POST /posts (multipart/json)
  API->>DB: Insère publication + médias
  DB-->>API: OK (id, champs)
  API-->>FE: 201 { publication }
  FE->>U: Affiche la nouvelle publication